 shares of
Class N Common Stock at an exercise price of $0.01 per share (“the G42 Warrant”).$q$),(17,$q$In December 2025, we entered into the MRA with OpenAI, under which OpenAI agreed to purchase the Committed Capacity and related services.$q$),(18,$q$In December 2025, we issued the OpenAI Warrant to OpenAI in connection with the execution of the MRA.$q$),(19,$q$In January 2026, we announced a multi-year deal with OpenAI valued at more than $20 billion dollars. OpenAI has agreed to deploy 750 megawatts of Cerebras’s high-speed AI compute, and OpenAI and Cerebras have agreed to co-design future models for future Cerebras hardware.$q$),(20,$q$In March 2026, the Company entered into a term sheet with Amazon Web Services, Inc. for a multi-year
